<section class="section black-800"><div class="section-gap svc-faq"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="section-header left"><div class="section-badge"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="badge-text">COMMON QUESTIONS</div></div><div class="max-width-42 faq-v3"><h2 class="section-heading small">A few answers to help you understand how we work, where we can help, and what to expect from an AXIOMET engagement.</h2></div></div><div class="faq-wrapper"><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">01.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">What does AXIOMET actually do?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">AXIOMET helps technology-driven companies solve complex challenges across strategy, engineering, AI, and intelligent systems—from defining the right direction to building scalable solutions.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">02.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">What types of companies do you work with?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">Teams much like the clients in this case study: product companies pairing hardware with software, including fleet operators, lab-equipment makers, energy start-ups, and enterprise R&amp;D groups.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">03.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">Can AXIOMET help us if we only have an idea?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">Yes. Several projects in our portfolio began as a single sketch—we turn the concept into a testable hypothesis, a costed first milestone, and a bench prototype you can show investors or leadership.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">04.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">Do you provide strategy or actual engineering support?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">Both, as our case studies show: a short direction-setting phase is followed by our own engineers writing firmware, training models, and supporting rollout until the system runs without us.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">05.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">How do you approach a complex technical problem?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">We write down the target metric, instrument the current setup to see where it really fails, sketch two or three competing designs, and build the cheapest one able to confirm our leading theory.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">06.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3 last"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">What makes AXIOMET different from a traditional consultancy?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">We measure ourselves on shipped results, not hours billed. Each engagement ends with systems running in the field, documented decisions, and a client team trained to extend the work after we leave.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="marque-list-wrap svc-faq"><div class="logo-marque-list approach-v3"><img src="/images/6ac4fbdd876